=== a2d14_a2_m_FlowerPot ===
You find Mary-Ann with a large pot between her legs.
Steam rising from its boiling contents.
She looks fully entranced by the flower blossoms she's nervously plucking apart 
falling into the boiling water, wilting immediately.
*\[speak to her\]
    All you get in response is a slightly furled brow.
    The woman won't so much as turn towards you.
//could try to tell her not to coddle June here?
*\[you leave her be\]
*\[watch the blossoms with her\]
